        <p source="#source-43205-43252"><seg source="#source-43205-43223">ちぬの浦曲の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-43223-43250"><rb>虚舟</rb><rt>おぼろぶね</rt></ruby></p>
        <p source="#source-43252-43293"><seg source="#source-43252-43267">沈める星の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-43267-43282"><rb>光</rb><rt>かげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-43282-43293">見れば</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-43293-43327"><seg source="#source-43293-43327">思ひよ空にさわぐらむ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-43327-43359"><seg source="#source-43327-43359">靜かにそゝぐ水にすら</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-43359-43400"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-43359-43374"><rb>地</rb><rt>つち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-43374-43400">ぬらさじと心して</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-43400-43429"><seg source="#source-43400-43429">葬りにけむ春くれて</seg></p>
