        <p source="#source-46181-46213"><seg source="#source-46181-46213">檜扇あげてさしまねき</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-46213-46248"><seg source="#source-46213-46248">散りかふ花にまがひたる</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-46248-46282"><seg source="#source-46248-46282">胡蝶の魂をかへすとも</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-46282-46308"><seg source="#source-46282-46308">額にかゝる前髮の</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-46308-46355"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46308-46323"><rb>丸</rb><rt>まろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46323-46355">がれたるもかゝげねば</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-46355-46381"><seg source="#source-46355-46381">秋の風吹く中空に</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-46381-46412"><seg source="#source-46381-46412">迷へる夢はかへらじ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-46412-46459"><seg source="#source-46412-46418">星の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-46418-46439"><rb>凶光</rb><rt>まびき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-46439-46459">のあらはれて</seg></p>
