        <p source="#source-49826-49860"><seg source="#source-49826-49860">人をも薔薇の埋みつゝ</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-49860-49919"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-49860-49872"><rb>裁</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-49872-49890">たまくをしき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-49890-49914"><rb>唐綾</rb><rt>からあや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-49914-49919">の</seg></p>
