        <p source="#source-49960-49986"><seg source="#source-49960-49986">夢驚かす風の音は</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-49986-50020"><seg source="#source-49986-50020">閨のほとりに騷がねば</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-50020-50037"><seg source="#source-50020-50037">紅匂ふ唇に</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-50037-50072"><seg source="#source-50037-50072">やさしき息のかよへりや</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-50072-50104"><seg source="#source-50072-50104">花ぐしおちしまへ髮に</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-50104-50147"><seg source="#source-50104-50119">光を投げん</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-50119-50131"><rb>灯</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-50131-50147">は消えぬ</seg></p>
