        <p source="#source-50567-50617"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-50567-50582"><rb>荒</rb><rt>あれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-50582-50588">たる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-50588-50603"><rb>館</rb><rt>たち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-50603-50617">の花妻の</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-50617-50654"><seg source="#source-50617-50654">夢よ醉ふらん薔薇の香に</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-50654-50680"><seg source="#source-50654-50680">南の空に秋立ちて</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-50680-50712"><seg source="#source-50680-50712">常世の雁はかへれども</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-50712-50750"><seg source="#source-50712-50750">まぼろしなれやうたゝねの</seg></p>
