        <p source="#source-50957-51001"><seg source="#source-50957-50972">浮べる雲の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-50972-50996"><rb>一綫</rb><rt>ひとすぢ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-50996-51001">は</seg></p>
