        <p source="#source-65292-65345"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-65292-65304"><rb>出</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-65304-65307">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-65307-65319"><rb>入</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-65319-65345">るあたり草枯れて</seg></p>
