        <p source="#source-65404-65475"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-65404-65419"><rb>動</rb><rt>うご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-65419-65434">くと見えて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-65434-65446"><rb>日</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-65446-65449">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-65449-65470"><rb>寂寞</rb><rt>しづか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-65470-65475">に</seg></p>
