        <p source="#source-70593-70604"><seg source="#source-70593-70604">羨まし</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-70604-70630"><seg source="#source-70604-70630">誰をみ空の流れ星</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-70630-70650"><seg source="#source-70630-70650">暮るれば出て</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-70650-70669"><seg source="#source-70650-70669">光知るらん</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-70669-70701"><seg source="#source-70669-70701">暮るれば出る星ならで</seg></p>
