        <p source="#source-71161-71220"><seg source="#source-71161-71173">あじさし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71173-71185"><rb>翔</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71185-71191">ける</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71191-71215"><rb>白濱</rb><rt>しらはま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71215-71220">に</seg></p>
