        <p source="#source-71249-71275"><seg source="#source-71249-71275">若き乳房も仇浪の</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-71275-71327"><seg source="#source-71275-71296">なぶるになれし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71296-71314"><rb>海士</rb><rt>あま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71314-71327">の子よ</seg></p>
