        <p source="#source-71368-71403"><seg source="#source-71368-71403">みだれそめしが戀ならば</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-71403-71438"><seg source="#source-71403-71409">京の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71409-71424"><rb>紅</rb><rt>べに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71424-71438">とや唇に</seg></p>
