        <p source="#source-71601-71642"><seg source="#source-71601-71619">三重卷く帶の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-71619-71634"><rb>端</rb><rt>はし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-71634-71642">長く</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-71642-71671"><seg source="#source-71642-71671">けぶれる髮の美しう</seg></p>
