        <p source="#source-72083-72130"><seg source="#source-72083-72101">あこがれ渡る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72101-72125"><rb>釣人</rb><rt>つりびと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72125-72130">の</seg></p>
