        <p source="#source-72475-72504"><seg source="#source-72475-72481">影は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-72481-72496"><rb>仄</rb><rt>ほの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-72496-72504">かに</seg></p>
